 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? That's a lovely treat for him. Do you have a tent or a big burlap bag? No problem. Okay, good. Put the dog in the tent first. No, it' today. I had to rebook, so I spent the morning getting him used to the tent. Put him in the tent for an hour each day for a few days, then gradually longer. No problem. The key is making walking in the tent part of his normal routine. Give him a long walk before the picnic and a training session right after the tent goes up.",
